Sci-fi themed terminal with system monitors, file browser and on-screen keyboard

EdexUi-2026 is a maintained continuation of eDEX-UI, a fullscreen terminal and system monitor styled after science-fiction movie interfaces. It keeps the original look while updating the app to run well on current Linux desktops.

- Fullscreen terminal with multiple tabs
- Live system information such as CPU, memory, processes and network traffic
- World map showing network connections
- Built-in file browser and on-screen keyboard
- Application manager for launching installed programs
